{"arT":[{"id":"arT","headword":"अर्थ्","headword_slp1":"arT","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ्, i. 10 (rather a denom. derived from अर्थ) Ātm. To ask, to request; with two acc. Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 199, 15","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". त्वाम् तम् इमम् अर्थम् अर्थयते, He asks this from thee, Pass. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Kathās. 22, 52","q":"Kathās"},{"t":"txt","s":". तैर् एवार्थ्यमानस्, Being requested by them.\n --With the prep. अभि अभि, To ask, to request, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Prab. 109, 18","q":"Prab"},{"t":"txt","s":", with two acc.; Par., with acc. and loc. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Kathās. 26, 148","q":"Kathās"},{"t":"txt","s":". त्वाम् भर्तृत्वे ऽभ्य् अर्थयिष्यति, She will ask thee to become her husband.\n अभ्यर्थित, Asked, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 189","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". n. Desire, Yājñ. 2, 88.\n --With कद् कद्.\n 1. To treat ill, Böhtl. Ind. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Spr. 591.\n 2","q":"Spr"},{"t":"txt","s":". To reproach, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 200, 15.\n 3","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". To torment, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Kathās. 18, 243","q":"Kathās"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With [] प्र प्र, To request, Pañc. 255, 22; प्रार्थयान instead of प्रार्थयमान, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 25, 31","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":"; with inf. किम् इदं प्रार्थितं कर्तुम्, What is this which you intend to do? "},{"t":"cite","s":"Nal. 19, 15","q":"Nal"},{"t":"txt","s":"; Par. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 3, 40, 6","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":"; Pañc. 96, 5.\n तत्प्रार्थित, i. e. तद्-, adj. Requested by him, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 197, 8","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Pass. प्रार्थ्य, To be desired, ib. 184, 17.\n --With अभिप्र अभि-प्र, To wish, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 11, 3","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With संप्र सम्-प्र, To request, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 5, 18","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With प्रति प्रति, To challenge, Bhaṭṭ. 6, 25.\n --With सम् सम् (rather a denom. derived from समर्थ),\n 1. To prepare, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 4, 26, 25","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":" (Par.); "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 55, 7.\n 2","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". To consider, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 6, 101, 17.\n 3","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":". To expect, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Vikr. 20, 9.\n 4","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". To interpret, Śāk. d. 67.\n 5. To judge, Pañc. 185, 2.\n 6. To approve, Pañc. 71, 25 (Par.).\n 7. To determine, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 20, 26","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":" Gorr."}]}]}],"arTa":[{"id":"arTa","headword":"अर्थ","headword_slp1":"arTa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ, i. e. ऋ + थ, m.\n 1. Desire; विवाह-, a marriage suit.\n 2. Aim; सिद्ध-, one who has obtained his aim, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 62, 60.\n 3","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". Advantage, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bhartṛ. 2, 40.\n 4","q":"Bhartṛ"},{"t":"txt","s":". Business, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 67.\n 5","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". Wealth, Pañc. i. d. 197; worldly prosperity, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 12, 38","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":" (one of the three aims of men; the two others are काम, pleasure, and धर्म, virtue); money, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 180, 19.\n 6","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". Cause, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 213.\n 7","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". Thing, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 8, 170.\n 8","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". Meaning, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 3, 186","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":"; true sense, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 1, 3","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":"; thought, word, Śāk. d. 164.\n 9. In law: A suit, an action.\n 10. The acc. अर्थम् is used as an adverb, but almost always at the end of a compound word, implying, ‘for,’ ‘on account of,’ e. g. यज्ञ-सिद्धि-अर्थम्, For the performance of sacrifices, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 1, 23","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". The dat. अर्थाय, and loc. अर्थे, may be also used at the end of a compound word, or may govern the genitive. Abl. अर्थात्, ‘to wit,’ ‘namely,’ Sch. Śāk. d. 41.\n --Comp."}]}]}],"arTakara":[{"id":"arTakara","headword":"अर्थकर","headword_slp1":"arTakara","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ-कर, adj., f. री, Useful, Hit. Pr. d. 18."}]}]}],"arTakft":[{"id":"arTakft","headword":"अर्थकृत्","headword_slp1":"arTakft","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ-कृ + त्, adj. Useful, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Indr. 5, 56","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"arTaGna":[{"id":"arTaGna","headword":"अर्थघ्न","headword_slp1":"arTaGna","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ-घ्न, adj., f. नी, Prodigal, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 9, 80","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"arTajata":[{"id":"arTajAta","headword":"अर्थजात","headword_slp1":"arTajAta","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ-जात (vb. जन्), n.\n 1. Money's worth, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 192, 16.\n 2","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". Financial affairs, Śāk. 90, 13 (Prākṛ.)"}]}]}],"arTatas":[{"id":"arTatas","headword":"अर्थतस्","headword_slp1":"arTatas","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ-तस्, adv. Truly, Vedāntas. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 202, 5","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"arTada":[{"id":"arTada","headword":"अर्थद","headword_slp1":"arTada","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ-द (vb. दा), adj.\n 1. Useful, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Kathās. 17, 122.\n 2","q":"Kathās"},{"t":"txt","s":". Liberal, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 109","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"arTana":[{"id":"arTanA","headword":"अर्थना","headword_slp1":"arTanA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ् + अना, f. A request, Naiṣ. 5, 112."}]}]}],"arTavat":[{"id":"arTavat","headword":"अर्थवत्","headword_slp1":"arTavat","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ + वत्, adv. According to the object, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 5, 134","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"arTavant":[{"id":"arTavant","headword":"अर्थवन्त्","headword_slp1":"arTavant","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्थ + वन्त्, adj., f. वती.\n 1. Wealthy, Hit. i. d. 175. 2. Significant, full of meaning, "},{"t":"cite"